  "text": "Skip to content\nCareers\nOpen roles\nPortfolios\nReferrals\nAbout\nLogin\nHire with 8x\nFind your role\nBack to open roles\nBuilder in Residence at 8x\n\nOne role. One person. A blank page and the biggest brands in the world.\n\nLocation\nRemote\nStart application\n8x\n\n8x is the fastest growing company in human orchestration: we put the human in the loop, across marketing, engineering, sales and more.\n\n$7M+ Raised\n250k+ Humans managed\n50+ Countries\n\nWe bring together creators, operators and specialists and point them at one thing: growing brands. What started as a creator platform is turning into a service ecosystem that scales brands, from the first piece of content to the systems that run growth on the inside. We work with some of the fastest-growing consumer companies in the world. Small team, moves fast, cares a lot more about what gets done than about titles.\n\nThe role\n\nThis is a two-phase bet on one person.\n\nPhase 1: Two weeks of shadowing\n\nYou sit in on every call we take. Client calls, sales calls, creator calls, partner calls, internal calls. Your job is to absorb how the business actually works, where the friction is, where the money is, and where we are leaving things on the table. You come out of it with a document of what you saw and what you would change.\n\nPhase 2: Build the path to the highest-ticket accounts\n\nThere is no list waiting for you. That is the point. You start from a blank page and answer three questions: who are the biggest brands we should be working with, how do we reach them, and what does the offering look like when we get in the room.\n\nShape the offer\n\nYou design the approach and build the offer using everything the ecosystem can do. You pull in whoever you need from the team to make it happen.\n\nRun the conversations to the close\n\nYou own the deal end to end, from first message to signature. You earn commission on every account you close, and the bigger the deal, the bigger the upside.\n\nReport and plug in\n\nYou report directly to the GTM lead and have direct access to the whole team, including the CEO and CTO.\n\nYou\nHungry\n\nYou want to win big and you are a bit impatient about it.\n\nEntrepreneurial\n\nYou have started something before. A company, a community, a product, a side business. It does not need to have worked.\n\nFull of ideas, better at execution\n\nIdeas are cheap. We care about your track record of finishing things.\n\nComfortable with ambiguity\n\nThere is no playbook for this role. You will write it.\n\nDirect\n\nYou say what you think, you push back, and you can take it when others push back on you.\n\nCurious\n\nAbout how brands actually grow, and about the people who make it happen.\n\nWe care a lot less about years of experience or your degree. We have seen 22-year-olds outperform 30-year-olds and the other way around.\n\nBuilder in Residence at 8x\n\nStart application\nMeet the people\nwho work at 8x.\n\nShort clips from people on the team, in their own words. Hover to watch, click for sound.\n\nTheo\nCTO\nJaka\nCEO\nZoja\nNil\nAnanda\nHussain\nSaloni\nLu Min\nMaham\nSami\nVania\nApply for this role\n\nTell us what you have built. The questions take about fifteen minutes, and you can come back to a half-finished application at any point.\n\nStart application\nFind a role\nand send us your work.\nFind your role\nOpen roles\nPortfolios\nReferrals\nAbout 8x\n\nRemote-first,\nbuilt from San Francisco.\n\n8x Careers\nBack to the beginning"
